<title>UK: S&amp;P rates International Bk of Asia FRNs.</title>
<headline>S&amp;P rates International Bk of Asia FRNs.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-11-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Standard &amp; poor's said on Thursday it assigned its BBB long-term rating to International Bank of Asia Ltd's (IBA) HK$500 million negotiable floating-rate certificates of deposit.</p>
<p>Standard &amp; Poor's has also assigned its BBB long-term counterparty credit rating and A3 short-term counterparty credit rating to the company, it said in a statement.</p>
<p>--International Bonds Unit +44 171 542 4041</p>
</text>
